   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Readiness travels as events (controller \u2192 RabbitMQ \u2192 API \u2192 WebSocket), not by polling the VM.",
   "originalText": "Readiness travels as events (controller \u2192 RabbitMQ \u2192 API \u2192 WebSocket), not by polling the VM.",
